\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . O Thou, who at Thy Eucharist dids't pray
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj That all Thy Church might be forever one,
\par Grant us at every Eucharist to say
\par With longing heart and soul, "Thy will be done"
\par Oh, may we all one Bread, one Body be,
\par Through this blest Sacrament of unity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. For all Thy Church, O Lord, we intercede;
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj Make Thou our sad divisions soon to cease;
\par Draw us the nearer each to each, we plead,
\par By drawing all to Thee, O Prince of  Peace;
\par Thus may we all one Bread, one Body be,
\par Through this blest Sacrament of unity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We pray Thee too for wanderes from Thy Fold;
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj O bring them back, Good Shepherd of the sheep,
\par Back to the Faith which Saints believed of old,
\par Back to the Church which still that faith cloth keep;
\par Soon may we all one Bread, one Body be,
\par Through this blest Sacrament of Unity.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  So, LORD, at length when Sacraments shall cease,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj May we be one with all Thy Church above,
\par One with Thy Saints in one unbroken peace,
\par One with Thy Saints in one unbounded  love;
\par More blessed still, in peace and love to be
\par \pard    One with the TRINITY in Unity.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

